     "value": "Homohexamer. Interacts with TOR1A; the interaction may be specific of neural tissues. Interacts with TOR1AIP1; TOR1AIP1 is required for TOR1B location on the nuclear membrane. Interacts (ATP-bound) with TOR1AIP2; important for endoplasmic reticulum integrity"
    }
